    "final_message": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API.\n\n- Added `POST /links`, `GET /links`, `GET /links/{code}`, and `GET /r/{code}` at the required root paths.\n- Added a migration and Eloquent model for persisted links and click counts.\n- Added validation, conflict and not-found JSON errors, stable creation-order listing, and atomic click increments.\n- Added executable [start.sh](/workspace/start.sh), which applies pending migrations and serves on `0.0.0.0:8000` with `--no-reload`.\n- Added startup instructions to [README.md](/workspace/README.md).\n\nVerified route registration, PHP syntax, Pint formatting, and the startup command’s supported options."
